OL,3,ARAF pilots who ejected moments before
OL,4,Acrash expected to make full recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo pilots who ejected and parachuted
OL,7,Fout of their plane moments before it
OL,8,Fcrashed are expected to make a full
OL,9,Frecovery, the RAF has said.
OL,11,FThe Hawk T2 aircraft had been flying
OL,12,Fout of the RAF Valley station on
OL,13,FAnglesey on Wednesday when it plummeted
OL,14,Fto the ground in the nearby
OL,15,FPencarnisiog area.
OL,17,FHawk operations have been paused by the
OL,18,FRAF as a "precautionary measure" while
OL,19,Finvestigations into the crash are
OL,20,Fongoing - the Red Arrows are included
OL,21,Fin the pause as the aerobatics display
OL,22,Fteam use the T1.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
