OL,3,ARAF pilots who ejected moments before
OL,4,Acrash expected to make full recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, the RAF said the two
OL,7,Fpilots, who were treated for minor
OL,8,Finjuries, are "doing well" and are
OL,9,F"expected to make a full recovery".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
