OL,3,ATrump offers warm welcome as China's Xi
OL,4,Aarrives for US visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe high-stakes visit - Xi's first trip
OL,7,Fto Washington since 2015 - is expected
OL,8,Fto include closed-door meetings, a
OL,9,Fstate dinner, and plenty to discuss,
OL,10,Ffrom AI, to the Iran war and Taiwan,
OL,11,Fand an extended trade truce.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
